break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/24のオンラインミート&グリート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/10/26/0347474/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部　ストレートに可愛いイヤリング〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部　乃木坂に入ってから初のみつあみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/10/26/0347474/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部　みつあみのまま可愛いえりのお洋服〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部　編み込み？くるくる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップスだけみたら可愛い系なんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日はレザーの短パンを履いてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘辛ミックスだったんだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年初めて私服で脚を出したかも(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/10/26/0347474/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどのゆなが好きですか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は11月1日の日曜日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとお話しできるの楽しみに待ってます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてついに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日は白石さんの卒業コンサートです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみでもあり寂しい気持ちもありという感じです(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくご卒業を見届けさせていただけるのなら、最後まで笑顔でいられたらいいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、白石さんと一緒にできる最後のステージです。色々な思いをかみしめながらパフォーマンスします☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非観て下さったら嬉しいです(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ちなみに白石さんのメモリアルマガジンはまだ少しだけしか見れていないので、近いうちにじっくり読ませていただきます( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとう！またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（10.26 柴田柚菜）"}],"source":"official"}}